# Line endings. The repository stores LF for every text file; these rules make
# every checkout reproduce those bytes.
#
# Why this matters here: `core.autocrlf=true` used to rewrite text files to CRLF
# on checkout, and `lib/` is committed and published verbatim, so the SAME
# commit produced two different npm tarballs depending on which machine packed
# it (LF after a build, CRLF after a fresh checkout). With these rules a clean
# checkout, a build, and `npm publish` all agree byte for byte.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Built bundles (lib/) are generated artifacts shipped byte-for-byte: never
# normalise them, in either direction.
lib/** -text